-- HTB deliberate change: batch 1 of the upstream group-tier review.
--
-- Copies Dictionarry's release-group tier and ban updates (Dictionarry-Hub/database, branch v2,
-- commit fb09c84, ops up to 381) into the formats HTB scores. Found by a three-way comparison
-- of upstream v1 at HTB's last merge (5ba1f9f), HTB, and Dictionarry v2. Steven approved batch 1
-- on 2026-10-19. Scores, profiles and HTB's own customizations are unchanged.
--
-- Taken:
--   - 16 new Banned Groups (including SPiRiT, which leaves WEB-DL Tier 4, and WKS); HDT into
--     Banned Remux.
--   - New groups and moves in the 2160p, 1080p and 720p Quality tiers, Remux tiers, WEB-DL tiers
--     and 1080p Efficient TV WEB Tier 5. Includes RandomBytes into 2160p Quality Tier 4, BTN into
--     1080p Quality Tier 6, and upstream 380 and 381 (TRUNKS into 2160p Quality Tier 5, ZnP into
--     Remux Tier 3).
--   - The renamed group patterns TayTO and RightSIZE, replacing TayTo and rightSIZE.
--   - Pattern fixes: BTM, E, YTS, Golden Popcorn Negation, and the UHD Bluray and UHD WEBRip
--     release-group lists. The E fix stops the ban matching E.N.D. CtrlHD, Kitsune and SbR
--     leave the trusted WEBRip list, as upstream decided (Steven agreed on 2026-10-19).
-- One difference from upstream: SiCFoI joins Remux Tier 4 as a release-group condition.
--   Upstream added it as a release-title condition, which the Arrs never match for that tier,
--   so it would leave SiCFoI remuxes untiered.
-- Not taken (batch 2 and 3 of the review): removals from Banned Groups and Banned Groups
--   (Efficient), the Efficient and Compact TV WEB tier removals, the SD tier removals, new format
--   families, and non-group pattern changes (HDR, codecs, streaming services, editions).

-- New group patterns (130), copied from Dictionarry.

-- Pattern fixes (6). Each only applies if HTB still has the old pattern.
UPDATE regular_expressions SET pattern = '(?<=^|[\s.-])(BEN[ ._-]THE[ ._-]MEN|BEN|BTM)\b' WHERE name = 'BTM' AND pattern = '(?<=^|[\s.-])(BEN THE MEN|BEN|BTM)\b';
UPDATE regular_expressions SET pattern = '(?<=^|[\s.-])E(?![.\w])' WHERE name = 'E' AND pattern = '(?<=^|[\s.-])E\b';
UPDATE regular_expressions SET pattern = '(?<=^|[\s.-])YTS(.(AG|BZ|LT|MX))?\b' WHERE name = 'YTS' AND pattern = '(?<=^|[\s.-])YTS(.(MX|LT|AG))?\b';
